Unrequested changes:
  1. [in_service] The parser tracks heading levels so that deeper sub-headings stay inside Context. A deeper heading that names a mandate section ends Context and is read as that section. No obligation asks for this nested-heading logic. The obligations only require that a Context section's blocks are recorded and not reported unread, and the scope exclusions rule out nested Context handling. The change also adds new heading-level semantics to the parse loop.
