    [prior_behavior_altered] no-context-task-file-unchanged-behavior/parsed-model-gains-context-field
      ParsedTaskFile gains a new always-present `context` field (default empty list). For a task file with no Context section, the serialized parsed model now carries an extra `context: []` key. If anything hashes, fingerprints, persists or replays that model (cache keys, recorded transcripts, stored review state), its output for context-free files differs from before, even though the prompt text is the same.
